Two configs for the run queue ([queue] long, checkpoints every 10 days, scorecard at the end), to see how the model
settles through freeze-up with the closure chosen on 24 Nov, and which drifts follow the closure.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
